@startuml Report_Mode_Sequence

title Report Mode - CrewAI Question Generation Flow

actor User
participant "Streamlit\nDashboard" as UI
participant "FastAPI\n/api/prepare" as API
participant "Interview\nPreparationCrew" as Crew
participant "JD Analyst\nAgent" as Agent1
participant "Corporate\nResearcher" as Agent2
participant "Lead\nInterviewer" as Agent3
participant "Groq LLM\nAPI" as LLM
database "Prompts\n(YAML)" as Prompts

== Initialization ==
User -> UI: Fill form\n(JD, CV, Company)
User -> UI: Click "Start Analysis"
UI -> API: POST /api/prepare\n{job_description, user_cv,\ncompany_name, company_website}

== CrewAI Orchestration ==
API -> Crew: Initialize crew\n(tone, level, verbose)
activate Crew

Crew -> Prompts: Load agent configs
Prompts --> Crew: Agent definitions

Crew -> Prompts: Load task configs
Prompts --> Crew: Task definitions

== Task 1: Job Analysis ==
Crew -> Agent1: Execute analyze_job_description
activate Agent1

Agent1 -> Prompts: Load JD Analyst prompt
Prompts --> Agent1: Prompt template

Agent1 -> LLM: Analyze JD vs CV\n(Groq API call)
activate LLM
LLM --> Agent1: Structured response:\n{skill_gaps, matching_skills,\nexperience_level_match}
deactivate LLM

Agent1 --> Crew: Job analysis complete
deactivate Agent1

== Task 2: Company Research ==
Crew -> Agent2: Execute research_company_culture\n(context: job_analysis)
activate Agent2

Agent2 -> Prompts: Load Researcher prompt
Prompts --> Agent2: Prompt template

Agent2 -> Agent2: Scrape company website
note right: Uses ScrapeWebsiteTool

Agent2 -> LLM: Analyze company culture\n(Groq API call)
activate LLM
LLM --> Agent2: Structured response:\n{company_values, culture_insights,\nmission_statement}
deactivate LLM

Agent2 --> Crew: Company research complete
deactivate Agent2

== Task 3: Interview Dossier ==
Crew -> Agent3: Execute prepare_interview_dossier\n(context: job_analysis + company_culture)
activate Agent3

Agent3 -> Prompts: Load Interviewer prompt
Prompts --> Agent3: Prompt template

Agent3 -> LLM: Generate questions\n(Groq API call)
activate LLM
note right of LLM
  Prompt includes:
  - Job analysis results
  - Company culture insights
  - Interview type (mixed)
  - Tone & level settings
end note

LLM --> Agent3: Structured JSON:\n{\n  technical_questions: [...],\n  behavioral_questions: [...],\n  company_specific_questions: [...],\n  interview_strategy: {...}\n}
deactivate LLM

Agent3 --> Crew: Interview dossier complete
deactivate Agent3

== Response ==
Crew --> API: CrewAI result
deactivate Crew

API --> UI: HTTP 200\n{status: "success",\nresult: {...}}

UI -> UI: Store in session_state
UI --> User: Display results\n(Strategy, Technical,\nBehavioral, Company tabs)

@enduml
